<!-- ════════════════ 40 · MODEL ROUTING ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Model routing" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #4f46e5;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" y1="3" x2="6" y2="15"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">40</span>Model routing</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Not every task needs the <span class="accent">most expensive model</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="problist">
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m13 2-10 12h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Small and fast</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Haiku 4.5, Gemini Flash, GPT-5.4-nano. About $0.20 to $1.50 per million input. For autocomplete, classification and simple edits.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"/><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"/><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Mid-tier</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Claude Sonnet 4.6, GPT-5.4. About $3 input. The workhorses for most coding tasks.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Top tier</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Claude Opus 4.8, GPT-5.5 (about $5 input, $25 output). Claude Fable 5, the flagship, is double that ($10/$50). Reserve for genuinely complex reasoning.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Default to the cheapest tier that clears the task; reach for the top tier <strong>only when quality demands it</strong>. Prices June 2026, verify current rates.
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #94a3b8; margin: 14px 4px 0;"><strong>Sources:</strong> Anthropic (platform.claude.com/docs) &middot; OpenAI (openai.com/api/pricing) &middot; Google (ai.google.dev). Prices as of June 2026; verify current rates before using in budget models.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "40" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "61" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
